  "authorization": "06-04 implementation and candidate preparation are authorized. No owner has approved these exact CR-006 bytes; existing CR-005 approval is not expanded.",
  "compatibility": [
    "00001..00005 unchanged; additive 00006 upgrade preserves seeded 00005 authoritative rows and unknown observations.",
    "Mutable catalog creates new versions; old package/source/billing terms remain immutable; only 00006 creates billing_snapshots.",
    "New subscription and package operations extend API 2.0.0 without changing existing rule, tenant or DNS operations. HTTP adapters are explicitly 06-07.",
    "Code grant duration and amount are persisted in the immutable snapshot; package version supplies capabilities, price and reset policy. Same-package live renewal keeps existing snapshot and source identity.",
    "Cross-package code preview binds code hash, actor, exact version and complete impact; confirm locks and consumes a use with redemption/snapshot/change/task/outbox/audit in one transaction.",
    "Confirmation accepts only non-past effective_at; due worker rechecks current actor and impact. Exact replay remains available after code exhaustion; changed actor/code/input conflicts.",
    "Accepted future grant consumption is final even if due execution rejects stale authority; no automatic refund/reissue is claimed.",
    "Restrictions clear only their own sources; no activation while any relevant cause remains. Expiry appends disabled revisions; unknown occupation and liabilities are never converted into free rights.",
    "Control 1.4.0, runtime 1.2.0, VLink and authorization artifacts remain byte-identical to the CR-005 approved baseline."
  ],
